# Project uses npm (see .github/workflows/ci.yml); a committed pnpm-lock.yaml
# alongside package-lock.json makes package-manager auto-detection (e.g. on
# Vercel) ambiguous, and a fresh `pnpm install` of this dependency graph
# breaks outright under Node 22. Use pnpm locally if you want, just don't
# commit its lockfile.
